#: rc.cpp:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Сарсухан"

#: rc.cpp:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "<u>KWallet</u> - The KDE Wallet System"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Welcome to KWallet, the KDE Wallet System.  KWallet allows you to store your "
"passwords and other personal information on disk in an encrypted file, "
"preventing others from viewing the information.  This wizard will tell you "
"about KWallet and help you configure it for the first time."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Basic setup (recommended)"
msgstr "&Танзимоти асосӣ (албатта)"

#: rc.cpp:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Advanced setup"
msgstr "&Танимоти пешакӣ"

#: rc.cpp:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The KDE Wallet system stores your data in a <i>wallet</i>"
" file on your local hard disk.  The data is only written in encrypted form, "
"presently using the blowfish algorithm with your password as the key.  When "
"a wallet is opened, the wallet manager application will launch and display "
"an icon in the system tray.  You can use this application to manage your "
"wallets.  It even permits you to drag wallets and wallet contents, allowing "
"you to easily copy a wallet to a remote system."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Password Selection"
msgstr "Интихоби гузарвожа"

#: rc.cpp:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Various applications may attempt to use the KDE wallet to store passwords or "
"other information such as web form data and cookies.  If you would like "
"these applications to use the wallet, you must enable it now and choose a "
"password.  The password you choose <i>cannot</i>"
" be recovered if it is lost, and will allow anyone who knows it to obtain "
"all the information contained in the wallet."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:31
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter a new password:"
msgstr "Гузарвожаи нав гузоред:"

#: rc.cpp:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Verify password:"
msgstr "Тасдиқи гузарвожа:"

#: rc.cpp:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Yes, I wish to use the KDE wallet to store my personal information."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Security Level"
msgstr "Муҳофиза..."

#: rc.cpp:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The KDE Wallet system allows you to control the level of security of your "
"personal data.  Some of these settings do impact usability.  While the "
"default settings are generally acceptable for most users, you may wish to "
"change some of them.  You may further tune these settings from the KWallet "
"control module."
msgstr ""

